# Hyprland, Quickshell, and their shared dependency chain exist only in
# trixie-backports. Pinning is required so transitive library dependencies
# (libxkbcommon, libinput, libwayland, libaquamarine, libhypr*) resolve to
# backports versions rather than older stable ones — apt does not
# automatically upgrade dependencies of pinned packages.
#
# NOTE: the pin must use the codename (n=trixie-backports), not the archive
# key — backports' Release file declares Suite: stable-backports, so
# "release a=trixie-backports" matches nothing and the pin silently no-ops.
Package: hyprland hyprland-* hypridle hyprlock hyprsunset hyprpolkitagent xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland quickshell uwsm libaquamarine* libhypr* libxkbcommon* libxkbregistry* libinput* libwayland*
Pin: release n=trixie-backports
Pin-Priority: 600
